      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but i really don't have time to go to the clinic today, everything is so expensive and it's a hassle. it was literally prescribed to me recently so it's not like it's old or anything. if i just take a few pills now, would that help clear it up before it turns into something worse? it's just a sore throat, surely it's fine to try it if it's already in my cabinet.",
